    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάφῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφύω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>germination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>division,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				495b9
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				1
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>partition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				562a26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>de Arte</u>
				10
			</span></i>; <i>crack, crevice</i> in rocks, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				102.21
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>gorge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.117
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>point</i> or <i>line of separation between</i>
			the stalk and branch, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oct.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>spinous process of the tibia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).475
			</span></i>.</div>
